# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work

# 编译产物。`go build .` 会把二进制放进各自目录（client/client、server/server），
# 所以必须写成带路径的形式：裸写 client / server 会把 client/ 和 server/ 两个
# 源码目录整体忽略掉，导致这两个目录下的新文件既不会被 git add 收录，也会被
# 大多数按 .gitignore 过滤的搜索工具跳过。
client/client
client/client.exe
server/server
server/server.exe
/tcp-transfor
/tcp-transfor.exe

# 运行期日志（服务端/客户端在各自工作目录生成）
sys.log
panic.log

# local end-to-end test runtime (binaries + logs)
.test-runtime/
